\section{Max-Mean dispersion solver}{

The Max-Mean Dispersion Problem selects a subset of a size that maximises
the mean pairwise distance.
\describe{
\item{\code{\link[=MaxMean]{MaxMean()}}}{Reinforcement-learning tabu search.}
